{
  "duration": 52.44,
  "match": 1.0,
  "lines": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "You reach into a dark cooler and grab a bottle without looking.",
      "start": 0.08,
      "end": 3.92,
      "matched": "12/12"
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "You already know it's a Coke.",
      "start": 4.04,
      "end": 5.6,
      "matched": "6/6"
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "That's not luck.",
      "start": 5.92,
      "end": 7.2,
      "matched": "3/3"
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "It was the brief.",
      "start": 7.24,
      "end": 8.32,
      "matched": "4/4"
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "In 1915, Coca-Cola had a problem.",
      "start": 8.7,
      "end": 11.64,
      "matched": "7/7"
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "Copycats.",
      "start": 12.76,
      "end": 13.56,
      "matched": "1/1"
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "Koka-Nola.",
      "start": 13.76,
      "end": 14.72,
      "matched": "2/2"
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "Toka-Cola.",
      "start": 14.88,
      "end": 15.76,
      "matched": "2/2"
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "Koke.",
      "start": 16.6,
      "end": 17.28,
      "matched": "1/1"
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "Same curly writing, same plain bottle.",
      "start": 17.52,
      "end": 20.0,
      "matched": "6/6"
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "You'd think they'd just make the logo bigger.",
      "start": 20.387,
      "end": 22.32,
      "matched": "8/8"
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "They made the bottle the logo.",
      "start": 22.72,
      "end": 24.6,
      "matched": "6/6"
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "They asked glassmakers for a bottle you'd recognize by feel in the dark.",
      "start": 24.928,
      "end": 29.0,
      "matched": "13/13"
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "Or lying broken on the ground.",
      "start": 29.2,
      "end": 30.88,
      "matched": "6/6"
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "A glass company in Indiana sent back these curves.",
      "start": 31.28,
      "end": 34.52,
      "matched": "9/9"
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "More than a hundred years later, you still don't need the label.",
      "start": 34.848,
      "end": 38.0,
      "matched": "12/12"
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "So if you sell anything, make it so people know it's yours with your name covered.",
      "start": 38.467,
      "end": 43.28,
      "matched": "16/16"
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "text": "A color, a shape, a way you always do it.",
      "start": 43.36,
      "end": 46.52,
      "matched": "10/10"
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "text": "Something they'd know in the dark.",
      "start": 47.04,
      "end": 48.4,
      "matched": "6/6"
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "text": "Send this to the friend whose stuff looks like everyone else's.",
      "start": 48.832,
      "end": 51.84,
      "matched": "11/11"
    }
  ],
